Verse 1
[Eb]Glory be to the [Bb]Father, and [Ab]to the [Eb]Son, and [Ab]to the [Eb]Holy [Bb]Ghost:
as it [Eb]was in the be[Bb]ginning, is [Cm]now, and [Ab]ever [Eb]shall be,
[Ab]world without [Eb]end. A[Bb]men, a[Eb]men.
